<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-055-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.294892" lon="-120.917569"><name>SC26-055-B</name><cmt>SC26-055</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 6.4 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 61/100; not catch probability. Center 152 ft; nearby 145–165 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-038</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.29667296716824" lon="-120.91889774096435"/><trkpt lat="35.29640263613755" lon="-120.9189046642967"/><trkpt lat="35.29641966001614" lon="-120.91989387608422"/><trkpt lat="35.296601771873256" lon="-120.919999175445"/><trkpt lat="35.29660933509784" lon="-120.92043882640885"/><trkpt lat="35.29561812027191" lon="-120.92046419266056"/><trkpt lat="35.2955204469006" lon="-120.92002685349821"/><trkpt lat="35.295160005195804" lon="-120.92003607918838"/><trkpt lat="35.29516378680711" lon="-120.92025590075652"/><trkpt lat="35.29408057071999" lon="-120.9201736645952"/><trkpt lat="35.29408624246226" lon="-120.92050339261371"/><trkpt lat="35.29345546912249" lon="-120.92051953291126"/><trkpt lat="35.292084903801275" lon="-120.91945505130066"/><trkpt lat="35.29179943909914" lon="-120.91858272224377"/><trkpt lat="35.291876302513